---
import { SOP_RULES } from '../data/equipmentData';
---

<section id="syarat" class="py-14 sm:py-20 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-14">
    <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-campfire-light text-campfire font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
      Transparan & Tanpa Drama
    </span>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-pine-700 tracking-tight">
      SOP Rental & Ketentuan Jaminan
    </h2>
    <p class="text-stone-muted text-sm sm:text-base mt-2">
      Harap baca aturan dasar ini agar proses serah terima alat di basecamp berjalan lancar tanpa hambatan.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
    {SOP_RULES.map((rule, idx) => (
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-border p-6 shadow-xs hover:border-pine-600 transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-pine-50 border border-pine-100 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-4">
            {rule.icon}
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-pine-700 mb-2">
            {rule.title}
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-muted leading-relaxed">
            {rule.desc}
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-stone-border flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-semibold text-stone-muted">
          <span>Aturan #{idx + 1}</span>
          <span class="text-pine-600 font-bold">Wajib Dipahami</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}

    <!-- Banner Callout Card -->
    <div class="bg-pine-700 text-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-pine-800 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-4">
          🛡️
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-white mb-2">
          Komitmen Keamanan & Kebersihan
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-200 leading-relaxed">
          Seluruh tenda kami cek kebocorannya, sleeping bag dicuci dengan deterjen antibakteri, dan kompor ditest pemantiknya sebelum diserahkan kepada Anda.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-pine-600 text-[11px] text-stone-300 font-semibold">
        100% Quality Checked
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

